        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">How many sessions does individual therapy take?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">It varies by person and by subject. When working on a defined issue, most processes are completed within 8–20 sessions. Deeper work can run longer.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We review where we are together at regular intervals. If you want to stop, you can say so; there is no obligation to continue.</p>
